  "description": "Add a real multi-turn agent for the live-loop harness: a makeRealLoopAgent({model}) that per turn runs claude -p (reusing the B-0c07 parseClaudeResult hardening for non-JSON/API-error/type-safe cost) on {ws, context}, HONORS the AbortSignal (kills its child on signal.aborted, per the B-c023 contract), and returns {actions, shipped, output, costUsd, tokensSpent}; wire live-loop-harness.mjs --run to drive runInjectionLoopArms over the 9 stateful scenarios with this real agent and append a powered-records jsonl. Hermetic --self-check (stub multi-turn agent, 0 spend) verifies the wiring + signal honoring + record schema; the REAL powered run is a cost-gated step the operator triggers. Scenarios/classify unchanged from B-d43f. Modify live-loop-harness.mjs (+ maybe a new real-loop-agent.mjs) + CHANGELOG; do NOT touch probe-contract / the 6 stateless probes / run-recovery/run-ablation/run-a2prime.",
